Package: dbAudit
Type: Package
Title: Geochemical Certificate Parser and Validator
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Alejandro", "Verri Kozlowski", , "averri@fi.uba.ar",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8535-1170"))
Description: Parses laboratory geochemical certificates into normalized
    long-format tables and audits them against client assay compositions.
    The package detects systematic identifier mismatches, flags value
    discrepancies, and writes audit logs for review.
